    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "一、周期求解题（可直接给出答案）",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            144,
            470,
            162
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5分)1、【2025成都理工大学826】",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            168,
            487,
            188
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "某信号 $f(t)=2\\sin(2t)+3\\cos(4t-3)$ ，其周期为 $\\pi(s)$ 。[元单位扣2分]",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            182,
            875,
            219
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: ${T}_{1} = \\frac{2\\pi }{{w}_{1}} = \\frac{2\\pi }{2} = \\pi$",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            214,
            443,
            247
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "最小公倍数为 $\\pi$",
        "bbox": [
            482,
            220,
            668,
            252
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nT _ {2} = \\frac {2 \\pi}{W _ {2}} = \\frac {2 \\pi}{4} = \\frac {\\pi}{2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            233,
            244,
            445,
            276
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5分)2、【2025海南大学888】",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            275,
            452,
            296
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)若 $f\\left( t\\right)  = 2$ ,【2023年7月1日 8:55】 $f\\left( t\\right)$ 的周期为 $T,\\;f\\left( {2t}\\right)  + f\\left( t\\right)$ 的周期为 $T$ (不用写单位).",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            287,
            660,
            319
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解：f由周期为T",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            318,
            371,
            350
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "最小公倍数为 $T$",
        "bbox": [
            542,
            318,
            724,
            350
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则 $f(x)$ 时域压缩. 周期为 $\\frac{T}{2}$",
        "bbox": [
            216,
            343,
            514,
            387
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "二、性质计算题（给出计算过程）",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            397,
            453,
            416
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5分)1、【2025西北师范大学844】",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            422,
            489,
            444
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\int_ {- 5} ^ {5} (t ^ {2} + 2 t + 1) \\delta (t - 8) d t = 0\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            450,
            448,
            490
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "8 不在 $(-5,5)$ 内",
        "bbox": [
            236,
            497,
            423,
            524
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5分)2、【2025西安邮电大学824】",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            545,
            487,
            567
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "计算 $\\int_{-5}^{1}cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi\\tau}{6}\\right)\\delta \\left(\\frac{\\tau}{2} +1\\right)d\\tau =$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            570,
            507,
            599
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: $\\frac{\\pi}{2}+1=0 \\Rightarrow \\pi=-2$ 则 $\\delta\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+1\\right)=2\\delta(\\pi+2)$ 故原式 $=\\int_{-5}^{1}\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\pi\\right)\\cdot2\\delta(\\pi+2)d\\pi=2\\cos\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\times(-2)\\right]=2\\cos\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)=1$",
        "bbox": [
            188,
            600,
            899,
            705
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5分)3、【2025中国海洋大学819】",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            701,
            490,
            726
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "计算 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{t}\\delta(2\\tau-1)d\\tau$ 。\n\n解： $2\\tau-1=0 \\Rightarrow \\tau=\\frac{1}{2}$ $\\delta(2\\tau-1)=\\frac{1}{2}\\delta(\\tau-\\frac{1}{2})$ 原式 $=\\int_{-b}^{t}\\frac{1}{2}\\delta(\\tau-\\frac{1}{2})d\\tau=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{-b}^{t}\\delta(\\tau-\\frac{1}{2})d\\tau=\\frac{1}{2}u(t-\\frac{1}{2})$",
        "bbox": [
            186,
            731,
            816,
            859
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
