    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4、【2025 西安石油大学 810】",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            111,
            421,
            129
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5分)(1) $f(t)=cos\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{3}(t-3)\\right]\\delta(t-2)$",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            135,
            507,
            163
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: $f(t)\\sqrt{(t-t_{0})}=f(t_{0})\\cdot\\sqrt{(t-t_{0})}$",
        "bbox": [
            200,
            163,
            510,
            201
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "故原式 $= \\cos \\left\\lbrack  {\\frac{\\pi }{3}\\left( {2 - 3}\\right) }\\right\\rbrack  \\sqrt{1 - 2}$ $= \\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{1 - 2}$",
        "bbox": [
            221,
            201,
            507,
            262
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5 分) 5、【2025 天津大学 815】",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            266,
            452,
            289
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\therefore \\cos (\\omega_{0} \\tau) = \\cos 0 \\cdot \\delta(\\tau) = \\sqrt{(\\tau)}$",
        "bbox": [
            149,
            314,
            492,
            353
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{故原式} = \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} d (\\tau) d \\tau = u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            189,
            351,
            470,
            391
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5分)6、【2025西安电子科技大学821】",
        "bbox": [
            193,
            423,
            522,
            444
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\int_0^\\infty \\delta (t^2 -4)dt =$",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            447,
            436,
            473
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则： $t^{2}-4=0 \\Rightarrow t^{2}=4 \\Rightarrow t_{1}=2, t_{2}=-2$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            472,
            594,
            507
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{则}} & {\\delta (t ^ {2} - 4) = \\frac {1}{4} [ \\delta (t + 2) + \\delta (t - 2) ]} \\\\ {\\mathrm{故原式}} & {= \\int_ {0} ^ {\\infty} \\frac {1}{4} [ \\delta (t + 2) + \\delta (t - 2) ] d t = \\frac {1}{4} [ \\int_ {0} ^ {\\infty} \\delta (t + 2) d t + \\int_ {0} ^ {\\infty} \\delta (t - 2) d t ] = \\frac {1}{4} [ 0 + 1 ]} \\\\ & {= \\frac {1}{4}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            223,
            502,
            932,
            581
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5分)7、【2025 中国传媒大学823】",
        "bbox": [
            194,
            579,
            487,
            600
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "计算 $\\int_{-2}^{2}(t^2 - 4t + 1)\\left[\\delta'(t - 3) + \\delta(2t - 1)\\right]dt$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            604,
            563,
            631
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: $\\sqrt{(2t-1)} = \\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{(t-\\frac{1}{2})}$",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            633,
            478,
            681
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{原式}} & {\\int_ {- 2} ^ {2} (t ^ {2} - 4 t + 1) \\underbrace {[ \\sqrt [ 3 ]{(t - 3)} + \\frac {1}{2} \\sqrt [ 3 ]{(t - \\frac {1}{2})} ] d t} _ {\\mathrm{不在范围内}}} \\\\ & {= \\int_ {- 2} ^ {2} (t ^ {2} - 4 t + 1) \\cdot \\frac {1}{2} \\sqrt [ 3 ]{(t - \\frac {1}{2})} d t} \\\\ & {= \\frac {1}{2} (t ^ {2} - 4 t + 1) \\bigg | _ {t = \\frac {1}{2}}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            210,
            674,
            675,
            862
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaovan.com $\\div\\left[\\frac{1}{4}-2+1\\right]=-\\frac{3}{8}$",
        "bbox": [
            154,
            864,
            499,
            904
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5分)(2) $f(t)=\\int_{-\\infty}^{t}e^{-\\tau}\\delta(2\\tau)d\\tau$",
        "bbox": [
            554,
            136,
            813,
            160
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解： $\\delta(2\\pi)=\\frac{1}{2}\\delta(\\pi)$",
        "bbox": [
            601,
            161,
            805,
            194
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{原式}} & {= \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} e ^ {- \\tau} \\frac {1}{2} \\delta (\\tau) d \\tau} \\\\ & {= \\frac {1}{2} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} e ^ {- \\tau} \\delta (\\tau) d \\tau \\quad \\mathrm{抽样性}} \\\\ & {= \\frac {1}{2} \\int_ {- \\infty} ^ {t} \\delta (\\tau) d \\tau = \\frac {1}{2} (u t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
