        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "设：令 $5 - {2t} = a$ ,即 $t = \\frac{5}{2} - \\frac{a}{2}$",
        "bbox": [
            107,
            161,
            421,
            206
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {\\mathrm{则} f (a)} & {= 2 \\delta (\\frac {5}{2} - \\frac {a}{2} - 3)} \\\\ & {= 2 \\delta (- \\frac {1}{2} - \\frac {a}{2})} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            156,
            201,
            421,
            261
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "即 $f\\left| t\\right|  = {20}\\sqrt{1 - \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{t}{2}} = 4\\sqrt{1 - t + 1}$ 故 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}(t+3)40(t+1)dt$ $= 4x(-1+3)$ $= 8$",
        "bbox": [
            161,
            262,
            510,
            296
