        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解: 系元作用: 让输入求以 $t^{2}$ , 让输入取e括数, 然后和加.",
        "bbox": [
            97,
            586,
            838,
            642
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {H [ a _ {1} f _ {1} (t) + a _ {2} f _ {2} (t) ] =} & {t ^ {2} [ a _ {1} f _ {1} (t) + a _ {2} f _ {2} (t) ] + e ^ {[ a _ {1} f _ {1} (t) + a _ {2} f _ {2} (t) ]}} \\\\ {a _ {1} y _ {1} (t) + a _ {2} y _ {2} (t) =} & {a _ {1} [ t ^ {2} f _ {1} (t) + e ^ {f _ {1} (t)} ] + a _ {2} [ t ^ {2} f _ {2} (t) + e ^ {f _ {2} (t)} ] \\textcircled {2}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            631,
            942,
            748
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nH [ f (t - t _ {0}) ] = t ^ {2} f (t - t _ {0}) + e ^ {f (t - t _ {0})} ③\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            157,
            749,
            833,
            793
        ],
        "page_idx": 6
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny (t - t _ {0}) = (t - t _ {0}) ^ {2} f (t - t _ {0}) + e\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
